  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Local-First Architecture**\n\nI\'m now contemplating the shift to a local-first application design, envisioning Google Drive as the synchronization backbone. The primary goal is offline accessibility on mobile devices. I\'m exploring the implications for data storage and management in this new architecture, and the complexities of conflict resolution. The Supabase backend will need to be transitioned.\n\n\n**Implementing Google Drive Sync**\n\nI\'m now focused on integrating Google Drive for data synchronization, specifically using the `drive.appdata` folder. Removing Supabase is the first step, and transitioning to local storage using `localStorage` is next. I am now exploring OAuth implementation via the Google Workspace APIs to sync a `portfolio-data.json` file. My attention is now on PWA setup with `manifest.json` and a service worker. The workspace integration skill seems promising to integrate with OAuth.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 657304089
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
