  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering App Structure**\n\nI\'m currently evaluating the architectural layout of this modular React app, which I find quite elegant. My immediate focus is determining the optimal placement for the allocation and predictive history charts. I\'m leaning toward a dedicated \"Portfolio\" dashboard component or tab as the most suitable location.\n\n\n**Designing Chart Integration**\n\nI\'ve decided to create a `/src/components/PortfolioCharts.tsx` component. This will house both allocation and predictive history visualizations. The allocation chart will compare current versus target category percentages, and I\'ll include interactive toggles to switch chart types, perhaps between a bar and a pie chart. The predictive chart will simulate deposits and show the deviation from the target allocation over time.\n\n\n**Refining Convergence Simulations**\n\nI\'m now integrating a simulation slider within the predictive chart, allowing users to visualize how deposits of varying amounts affect portfolio alignment with target percentages, demonstrating \"Predictive Convergence\". I\'ve planned to integrate historical deposit logging to localStorage. This enables a line chart visualization, showing real deposit history alongside the simulated predictions, which I think is great! I\'m creating the `/src/components/PortfolioCharts.tsx` component to make this happen, but I should look at `recharts` first to make sure I use it right!\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now create a brand new, highly polished, and responsive charting component, `src/components/PortfolioCharts.tsx`. \n\nThis component will feature:\n1. **Category Allocation Comparison (Current vs Target)**: An interactive card showing comparative side-by-side bars (Current vs Target Weight %) with high-contrast, elegant colors fitting the slate dark theme.\n2. **Portfolio Composition**: An elegant donut chart visualizing current asset category values (R$) using Recharts.\n3. **Predictive History & Convergence Engine**: \n   - **Hist\303\263rico Real**: A line chart tracking historical deposits and portfolio value growth. Users can log their calculated deposits directly into their local storage.\n   - **Simula\303\247\303\243o Preditiva**: An interactive slider allowing users to simulate future cash injections (R$ 1k to R$ 50k) and immediately see how future deviations decrease toward a perfect 0% deviation (showing convergence). This showcases the \"predictive\" core of the engine."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 591948767
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
