  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have successfully designed and integrated the **Macro Allocation Charts** and **Predictive History & Convergence Simulation Engine** into your application. \n\nHere is a summary of the accomplishments and visual design implementation:\n\n### \360\237\223\212 Painel de An\303\241lise Visual do Portf\303\263lio (Visual Dashboard)\nThe interface is now framed by a full-width interactive charting panel that resides gracefully at the top of the workspace:\n*   **Aloca\303\247\303\243o Macro Tab**:\n    *   **Comparativo de Pesos (Bar Chart)**: A side-by-side bar chart showing **Alvo %** (Indigo), **Atual %** (Zinc/Slate), and **Futuro %** (Emerald) for each asset class. This lets you visually grasp which sectors are underweight or overweight, and how your simulated deposit will align them.\n    *   **Distribui\303\247\303\243o Patrimonial (Donut Chart)**: An interactive, clean donut chart visualizing current asset category values in BRL, accompanied by a color-coded legend detailing absolute balances.\n*   **Hist\303\263rico & Converg\303\252ncia Tab**:\n    *   **Hist\303\263rico de Aportes & Evolu\303\247\303\243o do Patrim\303\264nio (Area & Line Chart)**: Tracks the cumulative progress of your actual investments. It plots your total equity (R$) as an area fill alongside the specific deposit (R$) as a line node over time.\n    *   **Registrar Aporte (Aporte Logger)**: When you input a deposit and run a rebalance calculation, a helper card dynamically appears, allowing you to click **\"Registrar Aporte\"** to save your deposit amount and resulting total equity directly to your local history.\n    *   **Simulador de Converg\303\252ncia (Predictive Convergence)**: A mathematical simulation that charts how adding R$ 2k, R$ 5k, R$ 10k, R$ 20k, or R$ 50k progressively drives down the total portfolio allocation deviation to **0%**. This demonstrates the predictive intelligence of your rebalancing algorithm.\n"
