    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEzA5qo5Nos-9uWlWFyXs4FOG00w2IjGz1OPPbaXMLHMUCcKj5n35oHvcX1PM34ak2gsOhJpfUW1kR0dJlvy6cHdiOS5WVs0qbxjzTY4h7IOnVnqvrIU49cn3mKZsVyWt7qYP6EOqEK9XWkT6SSVXgNbWGTpV04B9I="
      title: "quantvps.com"
    }
    summary: "The `yahoo-finance2` library, an unofficial API for Yahoo Finance, handles configuration and validation in specific ways. The `setGlobalConfig()` method is deprecated; instead, options should be configured during the instantiation of the `YahooFinance` object[1].\n\nFor validation, `yahoo-finance2` performs validation on all returned data by default to ensure that the data adheres to an expected format and structure[2][3]. This helps prevent unexpected crashes or incorrect calculations due to malformed data[2].\n\nYou can manage validation in the following ways:\n*   **Skipping Validation:** You have the option to entirely skip validation if you understand and accept the associated risks[2].\n*   **Disabling Options Validation:** You can specifically turn off validation for options if you are experimenting with new Yahoo API parameters[2].\n*   **Handling Validation Errors:** When fetching data, especially from sources like stock screeners, the API might return data that doesn\'t perfectly match the expected schema, leading to validation failures[4]. To address this, you can implement workarounds such as:\n    *   Adjusting the Zod schema (if used) to mark certain fields as optional or to provide default values[4].\n    *   Using `try...catch` blocks to gracefully handle `FailedYahooValidationError` errors and extract usable partial data even when validation fails[4][5].\n\nIt\'s important to note that Yahoo\'s official API was shut down in 2017, and libraries like `yahoo-finance2` are community-maintained. This means there can be occasional disruptions or inconsistencies in the data[6][7][8][9]. Therefore, robust error handling and validation practices are recommended[3][10][5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH1gV7gL5WR6xMTLV-7Yf0BIqSSh5DQlHc9FbN43P7NdVU4yL_aZE5DsIekPupq9KN4IXrnCUw6Rpl_f6x-K3YKkT3gE9lhkkuU9atMPfvogYAfOaz3g1iJC_-Kcx9-khf9NxlUriEQJEbOs2RKF2A_lhTngT8ZRfulPwdebJdZaE6NEz4O_Qd3Pm6m-P9DiTt8)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF2jzzctSOMQZxDbgtCFfxgVp3NcLqIDR0LGs6s7sl2P8dClHobL3Vo4PUFuxuIDWYl_tqKjb300sgF4m419aX43_8GzHg92kbNiPPj8XFJEda7A8JcyXho7mh2FMRoa5lreFYo8R8_2cnZVMkoDdSJI2AkgLP93b3h7d2VQF1_)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGxNEALCxvHwFRy_YLnRO-dAGdCvADMahDjsOE3yFCVzdY8lOWFfLeRT3xh240j9SZBFj0Qzwu2Df1a6baPvXGadmtLjfBu05AoOY7tya_vZ9L7ULOfnmJXgAoxBcAt7w3ILtt5L-4sJzEFr2Vv7oDyXMk5AFM-KDnjv7g=)\n[4] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGbywCR86CF-I4vgbGzvbXsh1-UKI6ybime4ogOZzVvO4YwBQ9D7CcwXy7Nt4nV1MxMSuJF1SljGryr9eDYRpPUuEbsHUaeM_B_CVm59O49gLjfnBapNOpnAbOdBnar5WZ78AHR6dYjH9cIVeu_ytIUAUxH)\n[5] [omi.me](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEX7vRM7yGA4tdibMLPR7OHVCKLKYd8Pzw_m4ctPDTLf9tafIsbdUx1Bsw2OTwQ88ITErA4OBy80HQixArtRwpIi0UUH6vLErLbbVhCtFd63_FhzXxbSorkTqNOrmIEH7MmxbLQG19q75WX-ystgk80s5Nin2dGPxTBGyBd-cObvIlZPYp9UzJp_9dF4QwyQe67lwJIocmbR1g13yBNdb1E)\n[6] [algotrading101.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG2f-ehg2QKIGyEoHfVxSx_r80OjancIrGYUfl1ocASjHaUM0hgXsLau-5lzScsEwe29PyXqYMYJEYF-MSFPdGQPs0O3MDP1l9U8tF3kw4iW1xdltjBRtQizsuR8mWqkrhFTNJbssOVjYh5W4TUIEGdtbL3QA==)\n[7] [marketxls.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFNDkPIo78Wwt8uSATI84RD7mcfCHqqdy-ln1_QRrnBABfmUA_O-wqajpkBzXF_xdtSw5gqYvaNE2tPE2OrtjNITFHVgR8aGVkU7GAMbLjkFgK6sIYURA2SH_MxRzClXmEUA_IHjUcAKnAiqtnk8W3PPoY5emGF)\n[8] [npmjs.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE3vr_2ZCqrBWd0P3f0OTpuIAD_BxSfTx-g-xVIoP_0v8OIBHv4KnHMjZY-S8JJGYqb0zqNCwpXudcu9TXuoVnWqSotcSfFqvhWkPFyuLYH1jfgcg5MfvKPruflXrfHbm_6b6P3L-EZ)\n[9] [scrapfly.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHDt_XtOp66ZMW851liIhHr6itmx1-mG3z_jCPuvHWNalt2IpbrTubdfz8AUoD6ZQmFBach-9kQ1shPDg-QXzy6H1VT8j7jMpg_4XiROyT9g