      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHhiKr9vsVYor-SRIUb8Hn2y6hqmfAvcz9wsqk9vXZ4ks75rh2IPPh5j7SfjzMs5J0r6mpAoKKqNcokPDLWJejrnZg2Z_39YSis0kvBbFVBrKZSbcJPVAXHTkSAfWhXrf9mT1qgvUz-ZhOcJzMdG2DkMtavWA=="
      title: "github.io"
    }
    summary: "The `setGlobalConfig` method is **deprecated** in the `yahoo-finance2` JavaScript library. Instead of using `yahooFinance.setGlobalConfig()`, configuration options should now be set when instantiating the `YahooFinance` object[1].\n\nWhen creating a new `YahooFinance` instance, you can pass an object with various configuration options, such as:\n*   `fetchOptions`: Used for custom options passed directly to the `fetch()` API, like setting a timeout using `AbortSignal` (e.g., `{ signal: AbortSignal.timeout(10000) }`)[2].\n*   `queue`: Configures request queuing, including `concurrency` (defaulting to 4 simultaneous requests) and `interval` between request starts[2][3]. For example: `new YahooFinance({ queue: { concurrency: 2, interval: 250 } })`[3].\n\nAdditionally, individual API modules within `yahoo-finance2` (e.g., `quote`, `chart`) accept an optional third argument, `moduleOpts`, which allows for overriding common configuration settings for that specific request[2]. These `moduleOpts` can include `devel` for test cache control, `fetchOptions`, `validateResult` to skip schema validation, and `queue` settings[2].\n\nIt is important to note that `yahoo-finance2` is an unofficial API and is not endorsed by Yahoo Inc.[4]. There is also a distinct Python library called `yfinance`, which has its own global configuration accessible via `yf.config` for settings like `network.proxy` and `network.retries`[5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFyZ33IWyTSpCsd7ZFbA_YdNlc696wdxgKojuVhn7b013ofQWnQg7I82t4G3HmQEdcVa6xx5odXc4Rf3X0FO-qW6LvYFcP-9BXQVZeT3JDlXVdU0Rkl2IE2k0GxGvDjoAlQo7tZ63njkD6jxTWJth3qq080TLqBeAd4lz7zfKu6ySRoxpu2oD2d9wBC2bLLY9U=)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFMjKMdxLBgnVA4tfiTQHDK5HxNpgDHBgTz-OxHRTBRyvit4Ntb1iLYDsNA_AQyTLZzwYwc1l6X46ox-63PwW9D1OFdFWelWGzsw_H1L8ccAMtfuiDU6dzoPRsD1hOXyk5PeIW5lgokIr7MqwJ1X4nnLnRaqt_8Jf_lYA==)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGZMJgo_8as5gojANrTG7Lr7j4njG1tCuDC1pb47DekqrlL3Gn-Zh79yCwypqhYUUKTJpK1GfnGSR8ZEPwgcHHUor6Ik5DmeYE209dqaU9Ky6HSu_4iw0rvjRP93TTvQW2NrZV03MmVCJ7SCHQkC75QRMPkhoOJgmS5lvTX0l1m)\n[4] [npmjs.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGDiLxdHjT_IOA9FYCASgU2VLIelcy6McEzB1166cZgRIlzQ0MdGbGMwB1Fg2h_V0J4_4LWFLDsx0d8vH6xGHcVI5gPIOiiNw_htQarjkGS_r7-IOmjKnpUdHRYyQ3ggvjVd8b7yqE=)\n[5] [github.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHhiKr9vsVYor-SRIUb8Hn2y6hqmfAvcz9wsqk9vXZ4ks75rh2IPPh5j7SfjzMs5J0r6mpAoKKqNcokPDLWJejrnZg2Z_39YSis0kvBbFVBrKZSbcJPVAXHTkSAfWhXrf9mT1qgvUz-ZhOcJzMdG2DkMtavWA==)"
