    summary: "The `setGlobalConfig` function in `gadicc/node-yahoo-finance2` (now referred to as `yahoo-finance2`) is deprecated.[1] The recommendation is to set options during the instantiation of the `YahooFinance` object instead.[1]\n\nAn issue on the `yahoo-finance2` GitHub repository from January 2022 confirms that `yahooFinance.setGlobalConfig()` is not available as per the documentation.[2] The documentation on GitHub for `setGlobalConfig.md` explicitly states it is \"Deprecated: set options during instantiation instead. See YahooFinanceOptions for further details.\"[1]\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHblMw4vWlrbkAQfWa9jdsQsNDPCGC-NDBzDhpjfWYMQndDlUqNp3Mqg22upKP3XGV1JF0ZmN5RrjnvBzGpjF5ZHfStbvMA-a8cXRPle-b9xGH8FEjnGUcVEfdxmBlcC976oAdt53U-__tuIVVnqe2UhgVpsRSfSlcRew0Yx4IbJ9B7S1t-vDpfsOIKB8WSUbqI)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHZXaTFpNiSzaTTgwpK_Niom2RTcJzAHWDdK0pWI4ZR-IjofR6Hj0NQvTsBQmrsfdTgQj0cndqZXm_owBAEBWZxZEPx-vwK8uHx7iFovm68gOUyO1DNMJgLaPisjmJvmf8_KmPONGYVHR1_4Zrfqg==)"
