      title: "github.com"
    }
    summary: "The `yahoo-finance2` library has deprecated the `setGlobalConfig()` method starting with version 3. Users are advised to set options during instantiation of the `YahooFinance` object instead[1].\n\nThe library is currently in version 4, with version 3 being a recent major release. If you are migrating from an older version, particularly from `v2.14.0` which had an accidental v3 code release, upgrading to the latest v3 or v4 is recommended[2][3].\n\nKey changes and considerations for `yahoo-finance2` v3 and later versions include:\n*   **Deprecation of `setGlobalConfig`**: Configuration should now be passed directly when creating a `YahooFinance` instance[1].\n*   **Architectural Changes**: A major change intended for v3 was to initiate with options, e.g., `const yf = new YahooFinance(opts)`, to improve the clarity and reduce the messiness of global options[4].\n*   **Browser Support**: Direct browser support has been dropped in favor of supporting browser-like environments (e.g., V8, Edge, non-browser web-workers). The developers suggest providing functions to relay `yf2` requests via a server or edge workers for browser-based applications[4].\n*   **Documentation**: The documentation for v3 has been a focus, with efforts to move from markdown files to inline JSDocs for better maintainability[5]. The official `yahoo-finance2` npm page and GitHub repository link to the v3 documentation[2][6].\n*   **Renaming**: The repository was recently renamed from `node-yahoo-finance2` to `yahoo-finance2`, and branch names were updated (e.g., `master` to `main`, `devel` to `dev`)[2][6].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH9NlLYVHR5Zn41C-u8DfPbxKqSPl_A22Mw4dludEdVMFgww9nKzN2dhAqhXk41nMheYs5m_oWsklXTG1AadODTueKvzy4obYDtfsksx0GgVGSE5Dh-_ib9-yOcl4O-YlngrmbvTkqzNjDsT7oKOq9pqhh2bsegOuvMzlNOZtZOBokcRKcR71ERsBfAkMluUtUm)\n[2] [npmjs.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGDWWBriyT74t6Wh1Cz-ia18yk6_xQkmIGwTtiu6TmYKGlGM_7qnfed2t-jR-4APKXH2dlOe0ubEaOxx351Crc7meB2fcfs9029vHlbPAGKK7CZJA-ezfGQ7vAd1jRtu9mq6iVZvGuA)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGCMRWKVYJbGryvfpi89uOmQ1tQ5z8VcoXv8fP1LlIwD0aoBgpJwf_c0Gi7iPbfgPL050U1BMsuKJObXikFqKWLQGckedcnWpO-4Wv5cXuY9xonY83LxXH_uA5BO3p1WbUpxL4yJY0qvutK_bz_Kg==)\n[4] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH5lct5Diy8ulO0xLVV-jMu2uuBo4rfjviS6DsDgXqdYO-KGGXJD6rrMM--Lng_VjWYXcmNzCf5df0JPqHEsK1CCNQxK2ciYXxN3CptAjVmdTOvRKReVjn4bmHQoVagF1l4FuNlVb7uiMXMzkGLFQ==)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFw18Ql0c_PXdzTE9ZfuyX7yukc5OnvO5RNX7rH_UpxZnc0U7MYems7KeSYu1wkJTlHjW3S93oSLsIobzEKh-kNFwI7YadBXeTlBg8sUeC9zJwc4glUX2NdbWeFZfbWXfqy82h3Zc1I7Ll4C81KwQ==)\n[6] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQENYVidZwVtB1A1eyyUTZQoDPeDPmaa2-wl86SWrRwILh7Myt6Fb-jBGnwjP8tfyyTMsuVcRR9fNz6cbouw9V_oBYDqjHVADCC2SvFPo1Ra8oz6dskqzAzTS0NwIGv_ip-rwc8=)"
